2026-09-02 19:46:05 [gemini-3.7-flash] 
2026-09-02 19:46:05 [gemini-3.7-flash] They should appear after your `add_executable(romulon ...)` target definition. Once set, your
2026-09-02 19:46:05 [gemini-3.7-flash] project will route all standard I/O through the USB CDC interface exclusively.
