2026-09-02 19:53:43 [gemini-3.7-flash] • The 16-bit address and 8-bit data lines are aligned correctly on instruction boundaries.
2026-09-02 19:53:43 [gemini-3.7-flash] • The PIO/DMA pipeline is keeping up with the rapid back-to-back bus cycles of the inner `ADC #$01`
2026-09-02 19:53:43 [gemini-3.7-flash] / `BNE` loop without dropping cycles or corrupting the stream.
2026-09-02 19:53:43 [gemini-3.7-flash] • Streaming the captured frames packaged as JSON-RPC over the RP2040's native USB CDC interface
2026-09-02 19:53:43 [gemini-3.7-flash] provides a straightforward bridge to a host computer for real-time analysis.
