2026-09-04 10:38:44 [glm-5.3-flash] when the PIO burst streaming arrives. The romulon.cpp delta (the `cdcStatus` poll wired into
2026-09-04 10:38:44 [glm-5.3-flash] `runShell`) has one design issue noted below.
2026-09-04 10:38:44 [glm-5.3-flash] 
2026-09-04 10:38:44 [glm-5.3-flash] writeCDC can hang until the watchdog fires — fix before streaming
2026-09-04 10:38:44 [glm-5.3-flash] 
2026-09-04 10:38:44 [glm-5.3-flash] 
2026-09-04 10:38:44 [glm-5.3-flash] 	while(writePos<charCount){
2026-09-04 10:38:44 [glm-5.3-flash] 		uint32_t writeCount=tud_cdc_write(str+writePos,charCount-writePos);
2026-09-04 10:38:44 [glm-5.3-flash] 		writePos+=writeCount;
2026-09-04 10:38:44 [glm-5.3-flash] 	}
