2026-09-04 10:38:45 [glm-5.3-flash] cdcStatus: report transitions, not levels
2026-09-04 10:38:45 [glm-5.3-flash] 
2026-09-04 10:38:45 [glm-5.3-flash] `if(status)` fires every loop iteration while the condition holds. RTS is the problem case: a host
