2026-09-04 11:12:26 [grok-build-0.1] 
2026-09-04 11:12:26 [grok-build-0.1] int a07 = reverse8((pins >> 5) & 0xff);
2026-09-04 11:12:26 [grok-build-0.1] int a89 = (pins >> 3) & 0x03;
