2026-09-04 11:12:26 [grok-build-0.1] 
2026-09-04 11:12:26 [grok-build-0.1] - `reverse8` is being applied to A0-A7, but the bits coming from the GPIO are already in the
2026-09-04 11:12:26 [grok-build-0.1] correct order from the physical wiring. You probably don't want to reverse them here.
2026-09-04 11:12:26 [grok-build-0.1] - `a89` is only 2 bits but you're shifting it to bits 8-9. This is correct in theory, but verify
2026-09-04 11:12:26 [grok-build-0.1] your actual GPIO wiring against the comment block.
