2026-09-04 13:39:25 [grok-build-0.1] The core problem (recap)
2026-09-04 13:39:25 [grok-build-0.1] 
2026-09-04 13:39:25 [grok-build-0.1] `transfer_count` counts down from the number you requested.
2026-09-04 13:39:25 [grok-build-0.1] Right now your function returns the remaining amount.
2026-09-04 13:39:25 [grok-build-0.1] 
2026-09-04 13:39:25 [grok-build-0.1] You want the opposite: how many transfers have actually been completed (i.e. "value
2026-09-04 13:39:25 [grok-build-0.1] transmitted").
2026-09-04 13:39:25 [grok-build-0.1] 
2026-09-04 13:39:25 [grok-build-0.1] How to fix it
2026-09-04 13:39:25 [grok-build-0.1] 
2026-09-04 13:39:25 [grok-build-0.1] You need to do two things:
2026-09-04 13:39:25 [grok-build-0.1] 
2026-09-04 13:39:25 [grok-build-0.1] 1. Remember the original number of transfers when you start the capture.
2026-09-04 13:39:25 [grok-build-0.1] 2. Calculate:
2026-09-04 13:39:25 [grok-build-0.1]    `captured = (original_requested - current_transfer_count) / 2`
2026-09-04 13:39:26 [grok-build-0.1] 
2026-09-04 13:39:26 [grok-build-0.1] This requires storing the original value somewhere.
2026-09-04 13:39:26 [grok-build-0.1] 
2026-09-04 13:39:26 [grok-build-0.1] What needs to change
2026-09-04 13:39:26 [grok-build-0.1] 
2026-09-04 13:39:26 [grok-build-0.1] You will need to:
2026-09-04 13:39:26 [grok-build-0.1] 
2026-09-04 13:39:26 [grok-build-0.1] - Add a static variable that stores the original transfer count.
2026-09-04 13:39:26 [grok-build-0.1] - Save that value inside `startBusCapture()`.
2026-09-04 13:39:26 [grok-build-0.1] - Change `getCapturedSampleCount()` (your `snoopCount`) to return `(original - current) / 2`.
2026-09-04 13:39:26 [grok-build-0.1] 
2026-09-04 13:39:26 [grok-build-0.1] Important details
2026-09-04 13:39:26 [grok-build-0.1] 
2026-09-04 13:39:26 [grok-build-0.1] - The value should be in samples (not words), so divide by 2 at the end.
2026-09-04 13:39:26 [grok-build-0.1] - You should handle the case where `transfer_count` temporarily reads higher than the original due
2026-09-04 13:39:26 [grok-build-0.1] to DMA timing (use a clamp).
2026-09-04 13:39:26 [grok-build-0.1] - After the transfer finishes, the result should equal the number of samples you requested.
2026-09-04 13:39:26 [grok-build-0.1] 
