2026-09-04 14:22:12 [grok-build-0.1] │  Function           │  Exists?      │  What it does                               │  Suitable for `\n` → `\n`?    │
2026-09-04 14:22:12 [grok-build-0.1] ├─────────────────────┼───────────────┼─────────────────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────┤
2026-09-04 14:22:12 [grok-build-0.1] │  `std::quoted`      │  Yes (C++14)  │  Adds quotes + escapes `"` and `\`          │  No                           │
2026-09-04 14:22:12 [grok-build-0.1] │  `std::regex`       │  Yes          │  Can be used, but ugly and slow             │  Possible (not recommended)   │
2026-09-04 14:22:12 [grok-build-0.1] │  Standard library   │  No           │  No general-purpose string escaping         │  —                            │
