2026-09-05 10:25:37 [nitro@ryzen5] can i start with just a "User Interface" node or should i go with 3d scene
2026-09-05 10:25:47 [grok-build-0.1] 🟠nitrologic Relay 2.0.2 grok-build-0.1 𝕏 🪠 0.7° $0.005 9.131KB 10.22s
2026-09-05 10:25:47 [grok-build-0.1] Yes, you can start with a User Interface node.
2026-09-05 10:25:47 [grok-build-0.1] 
2026-09-05 10:25:47 [grok-build-0.1] Recommendation for your current stage:
2026-09-05 10:25:47 [grok-build-0.1] 
2026-09-05 10:25:47 [grok-build-0.1] Since you're just trying to get a basic "hello world" running, start with User Interface
2026-09-05 10:25:47 [grok-build-0.1] (Control node). It's simpler and more practical right now.
2026-09-05 10:25:47 [grok-build-0.1] 
2026-09-05 10:25:47 [grok-build-0.1] Why UI is better to start with:
2026-09-05 10:25:47 [grok-build-0.1] 
2026-09-05 10:25:47 [grok-build-0.1] - Easy to add a `Label` so you can actually see something on screen.
2026-09-05 10:25:47 [grok-build-0.1] - Lighter than a 3D scene.
2026-09-05 10:25:48 [grok-build-0.1] - You can always add 3D nodes inside it later if needed.
2026-09-05 10:25:48 [grok-build-0.1] - Most projects (even 3D ones) have a UI root or a UI layer anyway.
2026-09-05 10:25:48 [grok-build-0.1] 
2026-09-05 10:25:48 [grok-build-0.1] How to do it:
2026-09-05 10:25:48 [grok-build-0.1] 
2026-09-05 10:25:48 [grok-build-0.1] 1. In the editor, go to Scene → New Scene.
2026-09-05 10:25:48 [grok-build-0.1] 2. Choose User Interface.
2026-09-05 10:25:48 [grok-build-0.1] 3. Godot will create a `Control` node as the root.
2026-09-05 10:25:48 [grok-build-0.1] 4. Attach your `main.gd` script to it.
2026-09-05 10:25:48 [grok-build-0.1] 5. Save as `main.tscn`.
2026-09-05 10:25:48 [grok-build-0.1] 
2026-09-05 10:25:48 [grok-build-0.1] Alternative options:
2026-09-05 10:25:48 [grok-build-0.1] 
2026-09-05 10:25:48 [grok-build-0.1] ╭─────────────────┬────────────────────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────╮
2026-09-05 10:25:48 [grok-build-0.1] │  Root Node      │  When to use                           │  Good for hello world?    │
2026-09-05 10:25:48 [grok-build-0.1] ├─────────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────┤
2026-09-05 10:25:48 [grok-build-0.1] │  **Control**    │  User Interface                        │  Yes (recommended)        │
2026-09-05 10:25:48 [grok-build-0.1] │  **Node**       │  Pure logic, no visuals                │  Yes                      │
2026-09-05 10:25:48 [grok-build-0.1] │  **Node2D**     │  2D game                               │  Okay                     │
2026-09-05 10:25:48 [grok-build-0.1] │  **Node3D**     │  3D game                               │  Only if you need 3D now  │
2026-09-05 10:25:48 [grok-build-0.1] ╰─────────────────┴────────────────────────────────────────┴───────────────────────────╯
2026-09-05 10:25:48 [grok-build-0.1] 
