2026-09-05 11:36:05 [grok-build-0.1] - A simple custom canvas shader often becomes the "simple optimal" choice faster than expected,
2026-09-05 11:36:05 [grok-build-0.1] because it gives you direct control over anti-aliasing without much extra code complexity.
2026-09-05 11:36:05 [grok-build-0.1] 
2026-09-05 11:36:05 [grok-build-0.1] For a clean baseline, you should decide early whether you're willing to use one lightweight shader
2026-09-05 11:36:05 [grok-build-0.1] for line drawing, or try to stay with built-in nodes.
2026-09-05 11:36:05 [grok-build-0.1] 
2026-09-05 11:36:05 [grok-build-0.1] • 3. SubViewport + Texture Display Settings*
2026-09-05 11:36:05 [grok-build-0.1] Even with perfect line drawing, you can ruin the result at the display stage. Important factors:
2026-09-05 11:36:05 [grok-build-0.1] 
