2026-09-05 11:36:05 [grok-build-0.1] 
2026-09-05 11:36:05 [grok-build-0.1] The simpler and more consistent the redraw model, the easier it is to keep the rendering clean and
2026-09-05 11:36:05 [grok-build-0.1] predictable.
2026-09-05 11:36:05 [grok-build-0.1] 
2026-09-05 11:36:05 [grok-build-0.1] • 6. What "Clean" Actually Means Here*
2026-09-05 11:36:05 [grok-build-0.1] For your baseline, define what good enough looks like:
2026-09-05 11:36:05 [grok-build-0.1] - Thin lines (1–2 pixels) that don’t look aliased or blurry.
2026-09-05 11:36:05 [grok-build-0.1] - Consistent thickness regardless of angle.
