2026-09-05 11:37:28 [grok-build-0.1] 
2026-09-05 11:37:28 [grok-build-0.1] 1. Redraw Strategy (This is the Simplest Part)
2026-09-05 11:37:28 [grok-build-0.1] Since everything is discardable and you want a full redraw every frame, the model should be:
