2026-09-05 11:43:13 [grok-build-0.1] • Buffer layout* (what you asked about):
2026-09-05 11:43:13 [grok-build-0.1] 
2026-09-05 11:43:13 [grok-build-0.1] 
2026-09-05 11:43:13 [grok-build-0.1] Buffer (binary):
2026-09-05 11:43:13 [grok-build-0.1] [ x1, y1, x2, y2, x3, y3, x4, y4, ... ]     // POSITION (VEC2)
2026-09-05 11:43:13 [grok-build-0.1] [ r1, g1, b1, a1, r2, g2, b2, a2, ... ]     // COLOR_0 (brightness as alpha or intensity)
2026-09-05 11:43:13 [grok-build-0.1] 
2026-09-05 11:43:13 [grok-build-0.1] 
2026-09-05 11:43:13 [grok-build-0.1] This is one of the cleanest ways to express raw line lists in glTF.
2026-09-05 11:43:13 [grok-build-0.1] 
2026-09-05 11:43:13 [grok-build-0.1] Cleanliness Breakdown (Realistic)
2026-09-05 11:43:13 [grok-build-0.1] 
2026-09-05 11:43:13 [grok-build-0.1] ╭─────────────────────────────┬──────────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
2026-09-05 11:43:13 [grok-build-0.1] │  Aspect                     │  Rating      │  Comments                                         │
2026-09-05 11:43:13 [grok-build-0.1] ├─────────────────────────────┼──────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
2026-09-05 11:43:13 [grok-build-0.1] │  **Buffer for x,y**         │  Good        │  Simple VEC2 works cleanly                        │
2026-09-05 11:43:13 [grok-build-0.1] │  **Line semantics**         │  Acceptable  │  `mode: 1` (LINES) is the correct mode            │
2026-09-05 11:43:13 [grok-build-0.1] │  **Brightness**             │  Acceptable  │  Can ride along in `COLOR_0`                      │
2026-09-05 11:43:13 [grok-build-0.1] │  **Per-frame updates**      │  Poor        │  glTF is not designed for this                    │
2026-09-05 11:43:13 [grok-build-0.1] │  **Parsing overhead**       │  High        │  JSON + buffer parsing is heavy for small frames  │
2026-09-05 11:43:13 [grok-build-0.1] │  **Simplicity in Godot**    │  Low–Medium  │  Standard importer is too heavy for this          │
2026-09-05 11:43:13 [grok-build-0.1] │  **Standardization**        │  Excellent   │  This is the main win if glTF is first-class      │
2026-09-05 11:43:13 [grok-build-0.1] ╰─────────────────────────────┴──────────────┴───────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
