2026-09-05 11:57:29 [grok-build-0.1] Recommended Approach (Discussion)
2026-09-05 11:57:29 [grok-build-0.1] 
2026-09-05 11:57:29 [grok-build-0.1] You should separate concerns like this:
2026-09-05 11:57:29 [grok-build-0.1] 
2026-09-05 11:57:29 [grok-build-0.1] - `node.gd` (the `Node`):
2026-09-05 11:57:29 [grok-build-0.1]   - Handles networking
2026-09-05 11:57:29 [grok-build-0.1]   - Receives the `"draw"` message
2026-09-05 11:57:29 [grok-build-0.1]   - Stores the latest line data (as `PackedVector2Array`)
2026-09-05 11:57:29 [grok-build-0.1]   - Tells the `Node2D` when it should redraw
2026-09-05 11:57:29 [grok-build-0.1] 
2026-09-05 11:57:29 [grok-build-0.1] - `node2d.gd` (the `Node2D`):
