2026-09-05 11:57:29 [grok-build-0.1]   - Gets told to redraw via `queue_redraw()`
2026-09-05 11:57:29 [grok-build-0.1] 
2026-09-05 11:57:29 [grok-build-0.1] This is the clean pattern in Godot for this kind of thing.
