2026-09-05 13:54:19 [grok-build-0.1] 
2026-09-05 13:54:19 [grok-build-0.1] - Small to medium scope 2.5D games: Godot is a solid choice.
2026-09-05 13:54:19 [grok-build-0.1] - Large scope or very high visual quality: You will likely need more experienced developers
