2026-09-07 08:38:15 [deepseek-v4-flash] On a Pico, GPIO23 and GPIO24 are not on the header, but the RP2040 pads still exist. If they are
2026-09-07 08:38:15 [deepseek-v4-flash] left floating, they can toggle and create spurious samples even though `pinStamp()` ignores them.
