2026-09-07 08:38:16 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
2026-09-07 08:38:16 [deepseek-v4-flash] gpio_init(24);
2026-09-07 08:38:16 [deepseek-v4-flash] gpio_set_pulls(24, true, false);
2026-09-07 08:38:16 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
2026-09-07 08:38:16 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
2026-09-07 08:38:16 [deepseek-v4-flash] That gives unused pads a defined state and avoids phantom change events.
2026-09-07 08:38:16 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
2026-09-07 08:38:16 [deepseek-v4-flash] ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
