2026-09-09 16:58:11 [grok-build-0.1] When it's reasonable:
2026-09-09 16:58:11 [grok-build-0.1] - Personal projects or open source work
2026-09-09 16:58:11 [grok-build-0.1] - You want high-quality, context-aware help (refactoring, architecture, debugging, etc.)
