2026-09-11 14:14:34 [deepseek-flash] 🟠nitrologic Relay 2.0.3 deepseek-flash 🐋 🪠 0.7° $0.003 945B 13.64s
2026-09-11 14:14:34 [deepseek-flash] The error is not about JSON syntax. DeepSeek rejected the request because the total prompt is too
2026-09-11 14:14:34 [deepseek-flash] long for that model’s context window.
2026-09-11 14:14:34 [deepseek-flash] 
2026-09-11 14:14:34 [deepseek-flash] What is happening:
2026-09-11 14:14:34 [deepseek-flash] 
2026-09-11 14:14:34 [deepseek-flash] - Your request appears to include a large JSON fragment, likely from Godot’s `extension_api.json`
2026-09-11 14:14:34 [deepseek-flash] or similar generated API data.
2026-09-11 14:14:34 [deepseek-flash] - That content is being sent together with chat history and other messages.
2026-09-11 14:14:34 [deepseek-flash] - DeepSeek counts system prompt + chat history + user message + any file content + reserved output
2026-09-11 14:14:34 [deepseek-flash] tokens against the model limit.
2026-09-11 14:14:34 [deepseek-flash] - Code and JSON tokenize poorly, so a file that looks “only a few hundred KB” can easily exceed
2026-09-11 14:14:34 [deepseek-flash] tens of thousands of tokens.
2026-09-11 14:14:34 [deepseek-flash] 
2026-09-11 14:14:34 [deepseek-flash] How to fix it:
2026-09-11 14:14:34 [deepseek-flash] 
2026-09-11 14:14:34 [deepseek-flash] 1. Reduce the prompt size.
2026-09-11 14:14:34 [deepseek-flash]    - Do not send the entire `extension_api.json`.
2026-09-11 14:14:34 [deepseek-flash]    - Extract only the relevant class, struct, or method. For example, send only the
2026-09-11 14:14:34 [deepseek-flash] `ScriptLanguageExtensionProfilingInfo` entry and the minimum surrounding context.
2026-09-11 14:14:34 [deepseek-flash] 
2026-09-11 14:14:34 [deepseek-flash] 2. Trim chat history.
2026-09-11 14:14:34 [deepseek-flash]    - Keep only the most recent relevant messages.
2026-09-11 14:14:34 [deepseek-flash]    - Remove earlier large assistant outputs or duplicated file contents.
2026-09-11 14:14:34 [deepseek-flash] 
2026-09-11 14:14:34 [deepseek-flash] 3. Lower `max_tokens` if the API counts it toward the context limit.
2026-09-11 14:14:34 [deepseek-flash]    - Some providers require `prompt tokens + max_tokens <= context window`.
2026-09-11 14:14:34 [deepseek-flash]    - If `max_tokens` is very high, it leaves less room for the prompt.
2026-09-11 14:14:34 [deepseek-flash] 
2026-09-11 14:14:34 [deepseek-flash] 4. Use a model with a larger context window.
2026-09-11 14:14:34 [deepseek-flash]    - If DeepSeek’s limit is smaller than other models you are testing, switch models or reduce
2026-09-11 14:14:34 [deepseek-flash] input before comparing.
2026-09-11 14:14:34 [deepseek-flash] 
2026-09-11 14:14:34 [deepseek-flash] 5. Chunk the file.
2026-09-11 14:14:34 [deepseek-flash]    - Split the JSON into sections, process each section separately, then combine the results.
2026-09-11 14:14:34 [deepseek-flash]    - Or use retrieval/search so only relevant chunks are sent.
2026-09-11 14:14:34 [deepseek-flash] 
2026-09-11 14:14:34 [deepseek-flash] 6. Minify and filter.
2026-09-11 14:14:34 [deepseek-flash]    - Remove whitespace, descriptions, default values, and unrelated classes if they are not needed.
2026-09-11 14:14:34 [deepseek-flash]    - Send the smallest valid JSON object that answers the question.
2026-09-11 14:14:34 [deepseek-flash] 
2026-09-11 14:14:34 [deepseek-flash] 7. Check token count before sending.
2026-09-11 14:14:34 [deepseek-flash]    - Do not estimate from character count alone. Use the model’s tokenizer or an API token-count
2026-09-11 14:14:34 [deepseek-flash] endpoint if available.
2026-09-11 14:14:34 [deepseek-flash] 
2026-09-11 14:14:34 [deepseek-flash] 8. Check your router or wrapper.
2026-09-11 14:14:34 [deepseek-flash]    - If you are using an API router, make sure it is not prepending a large system prompt or
2026-09-11 14:14:34 [deepseek-flash] duplicating the conversation history.
2026-09-11 14:14:34 [deepseek-flash] 
2026-09-11 14:14:34 [deepseek-flash] If you tell me which DeepSeek model you are calling, the approximate size of the JSON you are
2026-09-11 14:14:34 [deepseek-flash] sending, and whether you can reduce it to just the `ScriptLanguageExtensionProfilingInfo` section,
